WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.469
Tammy: Hi everyone, I’m Tammy.

2
00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.904
I’d like to welcome all the ants that have hatched today.

3
00:00:06.905 --> 00:00:12.975
It’s our tradition here at the ant colony to meet with the queen on the first day after hatching.

4
00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:20.551
I’ll be leading you all to her. On

5
00:00:20.552 --> 00:00:25.288
our way there, I’ll give you a tour of the different parts of the colony. As

6
00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:29.684
you all know, this room is called the Pupae Room. This

7
00:00:29.685 --> 00:00:33.718
is where all of you developed in your final stage of growth. You

8
00:00:33.719 --> 00:00:40.129
see, the stages are egg, larvae, pupae, and then adult. That room

9
00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:44.642
over there is where the larvae are kept. This is

10
00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:47.051
where you become pupae. Everyone, say hello

11
00:00:47.052 --> 00:00:50.505
to Nancy, the nurse ant. It’s her job

12
00:00:50.506 --> 00:00:57.608
to take care of the larvae and make sure they become pupae. Ants: Hi, Nancy.

13
00:00:57.609 --> 00:00:59.763
Nancy: Hi, everyone.

14
00:00:59.764 --> 00:01:07.037
This room is temperature controlled so that the eggs will all be nice and warm before they hatch. Better get

15
00:01:07.038 --> 00:01:12.822
back to work. Bye guys. Tammy: Everyone, say

16
00:01:12.823 --> 00:01:16.535
hi to Fiona, the forager ant. It’s her

17
00:01:16.536 --> 00:01:21.194
job to make sure we have lots to eat. Fiona: That’s right,

18
00:01:21.195 --> 00:01:22.876
everyone. We leave

19
00:01:22.877 --> 00:01:26.966
the colony to find food and bring it back. Ant: What kinds

20
00:01:26.967 --> 00:01:29.509
of food do you gather? Fiona: For

21
00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:37.500
the most part, we gather seeds, sugar, fruit, and sometimes, if we’re lucky, we find another insect. I

22
00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:39.547
have to go back to work now. See you

23
00:01:39.548 --> 00:01:45.466
all later. Tammy: Everyone,

24
00:01:45.467 --> 00:01:48.593
that’s Annie, the architect ant. She

25
00:01:48.594 --> 00:01:52.038
helps build our nest and makes it bigger. Ants: Hi,

26
00:01:52.039 --> 00:01:54.089
Annie. Annie: Hi,

27
00:01:54.090 --> 00:02:03.535
everyone. It’s my job to dig and make new rooms and tunnels, especially now that we have so many new ants.

28
00:02:03.536 --> 00:02:10.598
Annie: Oh my, look at the time, I have to get back to work.

29
00:02:10.599 --> 00:02:14.456
Tammy: Now, everyone, we’re going to go near an exit to the

30
00:02:14.457 --> 00:02:19.631
colony. Be very careful.

31
00:02:19.632 --> 00:02:22.260
This is Susan, the soldier ant.

32
00:02:22.261 --> 00:02:26.350
It’s her job to protect our colony from predators. Ant:

33
00:02:26.351 --> 00:02:31.615
Wow. What weapons do you use? Susan:

34
00:02:31.616 --> 00:02:38.576
First of all, we use our antennae to smell other ants and make sure that they are a part of our

35
00:02:38.577 --> 00:02:42.916
colony. If the smell isn’t right, we use our stings to attack.

36
00:02:42.917 --> 00:02:46.078
Other types of ants spray acid on the enemy.

37
00:02:46.079 --> 00:02:51.639
Excuse me, but I have to go back to work. Tammy:

38
00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:54.430
Now we’ve come to the end of our tour.

39
00:02:54.431 --> 00:02:57.010
You will all get to meet the queen. Hello,

40
00:02:57.011 --> 00:03:05.160
Your Majesty. The new adults have come to pay their respects. Queen:

41
00:03:05.161 --> 00:03:10.557
Welcome, my children! I see that you’re all grown and ready to work.

42
00:03:10.558 --> 00:03:15.081
Working is very important to the survival of our colony. We

43
00:03:15.082 --> 00:03:21.087
need soldiers, architects, nurses, foragers, and many more. Ant:

44
00:03:21.088 --> 00:03:24.453
But, Your Majesty, what’s your job? Queen:

45
00:03:24.454 --> 00:03:29.851
My job is to make lots and lots of eggs.

46
00:03:29.852 --> 00:03:34.524
Ants: Wow.

47
00:03:34.525 --> 00:03:38.855
Queen: I’d like to congratulate you on your new life here in the

48
00:03:38.856 --> 00:03:42.196
colony. Now, let’s get to work!

